The Blooded Circle met before Rassimov where [[Shauna]] informed him that [[Stack]] hoped to join the [[Blood Spiral]] and offered to acquire them [[Medusa]] as proof of his allegiance. Although initially order them to destroy him, Rassimov's mind changed when [[Tantras]] suggested they send [[Kiel]] and his [[Casterwill Hunters]] to [[Medusa's Island]]. {{source|Zhalia's Mission}}

Following [[Kiel]]'s downfall, [[Marduk]] took his place in the Blooded Circle. {{source|An Ally from the Organization}}

After Tantras lost all his power to the [[Heart of Vlad Dracul]], he lost his place in the circle. However, [[Harrison Fears]] then took his place. {{source|Rassimov's Secret}}

On the longest night of the year, the Betrayer's spirit appeared before the Blooded Circle, warning them that [[Sophie Casterwill]] would stand at [[Nostradamus' Tomb]] at sundown. When Harrison expressed concern, saying Sophie's name, Shauna punished him by hitting him with a [[Bladewave]]. Rassimov then sent [[Marduk]] to finish her. {{source|Words from Eathon}}
